{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>值得注意的是，今年7月23日，段永平在社交媒體平台雪球上發表了他對近期投資操作的最新想法。雪球上有用户向知名投資人段永平提問：「阿段不會要減點泡泡瑪特倉位去買馬斯克的SpaceX吧？」</p>\n<p>對此，段永平回應稱：泡泡瑪特我才剛開始買啊！我猜10年內大概率是不會賣的。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"圖片\" src=\"https://d.ifengimg.com/w1080_h1221_ablur_q90_webp/x0.ifengimg.com/res/2026/B49C18CF72DC08B97A67A1C5358A676363ABB070_size169_w1080_h1221.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>截至今日收盤，泡泡瑪特漲0.75%，報161.4港元。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0805/a1f232cad2b34ac.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"圖片\" src=\"https://d.ifengimg.com/w1080_h1221_ablur_q90_webp/x0.ifengimg.com/res/2026/B49C18CF72DC08B97A67A1C5358A676363ABB070_size169_w1080_h1221.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-05T13:24:31.697368+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":3,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none"}}